msgstr "Vibratunes esalami mpo na bato oyo bazali na mikakatano ya internet to bipekiseli ya YouTube Music : bomba nzembo mpo na koyoka kozanga internet, mpe leka bipekiseli na ordinatɛrɛ na VPN WireGuard."

